        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>First Impressions DS-SQAx450 4-1/2\" Square Acrylic Door Stops</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nNew very contemporary design acrylic baseboard door stop from the <a href=\"/collections/acrylic-collection\"><b>First Impressions Acrylic Collection</b></a>. They are made from <b>Crystal Clear Acrylic</b>. Easy to install with included mounting hardware.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nPictured below is a clear acrylic door stop on a bath room door. These door stops are <b>So Clear They Disappear</b>. \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/clear-acrylic-door-stop.jpg?v=1704442272\" width=\"446\" height=\"350\" border=\"0\" alt=\"First Impressions clear acrylic door stop\">\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThese 4-1/2 inch long acrylic door stops screw onto the baseboard casement, door bottom or wall anchor, to protect not just the wall and door, but your door knob or lever as well. \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nAlso available: Shorter <a href=\"/products/3-1-4-inch-square-acrylic-door-stop-first-impressions-ds-sqax325\"><b>3-1/4 Inch Acrylic Door Stop</b></a>.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> for First Impressions DS-SQAx450 Square Acrylic Door Stop\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Total Length: 4-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Diameter: 3/4\" Square</li>\r\n<li>Material: Extruded Acrylic</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold Individually.</i>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<br><br>\r\n<b>** This item is Discontinued. </b>\r\n<br><br>\r\n</p>",
            "seo": {
                "title": "4-1/2 Inch Square Acrylic Door Stop, First Impressions DS-SQAx450",
                "description": "First Impressions Square Clear Acrylic Door Stops. New very contemporary design 4-1/2 Inch acrylic baseboard door stop. They are made from Crystal Clear Acrylic. Easy to install with included mounting hardware. These standard length acrylic door stops screw onto the baseboard casement, door bottom or wall anchor, to protect not just the wall and door, but your door knob or lever as well. These door stops are So Clear They Disappear!",
